            "kind": "REWORK",
            "comments": [
                {
                    "file": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
                    "line": 0,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Thu Nguyen",
                        "email": "thu@os.amperecomputing.com",
                        "username": "ThuBaNguyen"
                    },
                    "message": "Please provide more info why we need this option.\nIf the terminus support PLDM FRU, they why we need disable `expose the Fru data to inventory`?\nWhat wrong with that?"
                },
                {
                    "file": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
                    "line": 0,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Thu Nguyen",
                        "email": "thu@os.amperecomputing.com",
                        "username": "ThuBaNguyen"
                    },
                    "message": "If this option is required the option should be applied at these steps instead as current patch set https://github.com/openbmc/pldm/blob/68444190fe52407c05ab4f7220a7794ba3f0ad82/platform-mc/platform_manager.cpp#L27"
                },
                {
                    "file": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
                    "line": 0,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "ManojKiran Eda",
                        "email": "manojkiran.eda@gmail.com",
                        "username": "manojkiraneda"
                    },
                    "message": "+1 , Agree with Thu on this."
                },
                {
                    "file": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
                    "line": 0,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Eric Yang",
                        "email": "eric.yang.wiwynn@gmail.com",
                        "username": "fornchu110"
                    },
                    "message": "The reason for this commit is that when the EM searches through all JSON files for the interface specified in the probe field to perform `Getsubtree`, it aims to find objects with that interface and execute `GetAll` to determine whether to probe the JSON config.\n\nCurrently, even in situations where `terminus` does not support providing FRU information, there are still interfaces like `xyz.openbmc_project.Inventory.Decorator.Asset` under the PLDM inventory object.\n\nIf the JSON for EM in the system has probe conditions that use the same interface (for example, the current `entity-manager/configurations/meta/bletchley_frontpanel.json`), it will cause the EM to continuously attempt to perform `GetAll` operations on the PLDM inventory object. \n\nThis can create additional burden on the system and delay the time it takes for EM to complete the `Interface Added` process."
                },
                {
                    "file": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
                    "line": 0,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Thu Nguyen",
                        "email": "thu@os.amperecomputing.com",
                        "username": "ThuBaNguyen"
                    },
                    "message": "> The reason for this commit is that when the EM searches through all JSON files for the interface specified in the probe field to perform `Getsubtree`, it aims to find objects with that interface and execute `GetAll` to determine whether to probe the JSON config.\n> \n> Currently, even in situations where `terminus` does not support providing FRU information, there are still interfaces like `xyz.openbmc_project.Inventory.Decorator.Asset` under the PLDM inventory object.\n\nIf `pldmd` is still create the `xyz.openbmc_project.Inventory.Decorator.Asset` interface and inventory object when the terminus does not provide the FRU information then it should be a bug in pldm code.\n\nCan you confirm which service host the Fru interface of `bletchley_frontpanel`?\n\n> \n> If the JSON for EM in the system has probe conditions that use the same interface (for example, the current `entity-manager/configurations/meta/bletchley_frontpanel.json`), it will cause the EM to continuously attempt to perform `GetAll` operations on the PLDM inventory object. \n> \n> This can create additional burden on the system and delay the time it takes for EM to complete the `Interface Added` process."
                },
                {
                    "file": "platform-mc/platform_manager.cpp",
                    "line": 621,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Deepak Kodihalli",
                        "email": "deepak.kodihalli.83@gmail.com",
                        "username": "dkodihal"
                    },
                    "message": "this commit introduces a lot of #ifdefs. Is there a better way of separting out the optional code?"
                }
            ],
